# ── secrets: NEVER commit these ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Audit finding 2.1/2.3 — the parent project leaked a Redis password and an
# embedded GitHub token through git history. These patterns are ignored so a
# stray file can't repeat that.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!keys/license_public.pem
secrets/
*.secret
*.token
credentials*
orders.jsonl
processed_events.jsonl
usage.json
license.key

# ── local state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ctxkit/
*.log

# ── editors / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
